 titled nodes were written `\\begin{lemma}\\leanok[Title]`. LaTeX scans an environments optional argument immediately after `\\begin{lemma}`, so the intervening `\\leanok` ended the scan and the bracketed phrase fell into the statement body: the built site rendered 1,108 nodes with their name as stray literal `[...]` text and no title at all. Every occurrence is now `\\begin{lemma}[Title]\\leanok`.\n\n**Content-preserving.** Verified mechanically across all 29 chapters: non-whitespace character count, `\\begin{` count and `\\leanok` count are byte-identical before and after; the only other effect is that multi-line titles are joined onto one line. Zero residual `\\leanok[` occurrences remain.", "created_at": "2026-07-27T01:04:19+08:00", "role": "horizon", "kind": "agent", "files": [{"path": "MainProjects/Algebraic-Jacobian-Challenge/blueprint/src/chapters/AbelJacobi.tex", "category": "blueprint", "add": 3, "del": 6, "loc_before": 86, "loc_after": 83, "loc_code_before": 75, "loc_code_after": 72, "sorry_before": 0, "sorry_after": 0, "sorry_delta": 0, "decl_before": {"definition": 1, "remark": 2, "lemma": 1, "theorem": 1}, "decl_after": {"definition": 1, "remark": 2, "lemma": 1, "theorem": 1}, "decl_delta": {}, "added": false, "deleted": false}, {"path": "MainProjects/Algebraic-Jacobian-Challenge/blueprint/src/chapters/Albanese_AuslanderBuchsbaum.tex", "category": "blueprint", "add": 42, "del": 107, "loc_before": 1235, "loc_after": 1170, "loc_code_before": 1085, "loc_code_after": 1029, "sorry_before": 0, "sorry_after": 0, "sorry_delta": 0, "decl_before": {"definition": 5, "lemma": 38, "theorem": 1, "corollary": 1}, "decl_after": {"definition": 5, "lemma": 38, "theorem": 1, "corollary": 1}, "decl_delta": {}, "added": false, "deleted": false}, {"path": "MainProjects/Algebraic-Jacobian-Challenge/blueprint/src/chapters/Albanese_CodimOneExtension.tex", "category": "blueprint", "add": 31, "del": 88, "loc_before": 2085, "loc_after": 2028, "loc_code_before": 1882, "loc_code_af